# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of which git
# installation (WSL git or native Windows git.exe) checks them out or
# commits them. This repo is written to and committed from both --
# added 2026-07-20 after switching the implementation agent's git calls to
# native git.exe (see call_implementation_agent.sh) to close the v9fs half
# of a git-index-corruption root cause, without reopening a line-ending
# mismatch between the two installs as a new failure mode.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types: never run line-ending or diff conversion on these,
# regardless of the `text=auto` default above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
